# Squelch kanata snippet — hold the trigger key to dictate, tap it for
# the popup (Menu key in this example; change `menu` to caps/scrlck etc.).
#
# Merge into your kanata config:
#   1. add `menu` to your (defsrc ...) list
#   2. put `(tap-hold 200 250 f23 f24)` in the matching slot of your base
#      (deflayer ...): tap (<200 ms) emits F23 which opens the Squelch popup,
#      hold emits F24 while held, which the squelch-ptt daemon records.
#   3. kanata --check --cfg <your file>, then restart kanata
#
# Example (appending one key at the end of defsrc/deflayer):
#
# (defsrc
#   d    f    g    h    j    k    l    ;    spc  bspc lsft rsft menu
# )
#
# (deflayer base
#   d    f    g    h    j    k    l    ;    spc  del  @oss rsft (tap-hold 200 250 f23 f24)
# )
